{"unit_id":"Practice019__dsh-doubao-plugin#feature-1","repo":"Practice019/dsh-doubao-plugin","commit":"264394cba40eb0d33ba20d3e4d1d2a317d4966fe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"doubao-dsh-plugin 的功能「联网搜索」：用户在对话中提出实时信息问题时，DSH 可调用 doubao_ask，将问题发给本机 Relay 并返回豆包回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:475-480","index.mjs:578-605","index.mjs:640-648"]}
{"unit_id":"Practice019__dsh-doubao-plugin#feature-2","repo":"Practice019/dsh-doubao-plugin","commit":"264394cba40eb0d33ba20d3e4d1d2a317d4966fe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"doubao-dsh-plugin 的功能「图片生成」：用户描述想要的图片后可调用 doubao_ask；豆包返回的图片链接保留在回答中，并整理为结构化图片列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:475-480","index.mjs:658-715","index.mjs:735-746"]}
